WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.403 --> 00:00:03.653
Unit fourteen. Activity for Life!

2
00:00:04.573 --> 00:00:09.118
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.168 --> 00:00:12.224
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.274 --> 00:00:16.292
Today we learn about Activity for Life. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.507 --> 00:00:21.941
Physical activity. Say it with me. Physical activity!

6
00:00:25.474 --> 00:00:32.507
150 minutes. Say it with me. 150 minutes!

7
00:00:36.012 --> 00:00:39.846
Strength. Say it with me. Strength!

8
00:00:43.346 --> 00:00:47.196
Balance. Say it with me. Balance!

9
00:00:50.704 --> 00:00:55.054
Sedentary. Say it with me. Sedentary!

10
00:00:58.557 --> 00:01:02.573
Motivation. Say it with me. Motivation!

11
00:01:06.058 --> 00:01:10.058
Enjoyment. Say it with me. Enjoyment!

12
00:01:13.571 --> 00:01:17.788
Lifelong. Say it with me. Lifelong!

13
00:01:21.298 --> 00:01:35.945
Adults need at least 150 minutes of moderate physical activity a week plus strength training. Reducing sedentary time helps. Choosing activities you enjoy builds lifelong motivation.

14
00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:39.400
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:40.143 --> 00:01:45.430
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:46.630
Strength!

17
00:01:47.635 --> 00:01:52.655
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:52.705 --> 00:01:53.855
Enjoyment!

19
00:01:54.851 --> 00:02:03.214
Did you know? The WHO recommends adults do 150–300 minutes of moderate activity each week!

20
00:02:03.264 --> 00:02:05.867
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:06.538 --> 00:02:14.861
Think and answer. Which activity could you enjoy for life?

22
00:02:14.911 --> 00:02:16.061
Great answer!

23
00:02:17.135 --> 00:02:22.737
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:22.787 --> 00:02:25.633
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

